# Genavigeerde kenmerk-lezing in conditie-positie (IR-SPEC ch. 4.1a/5, WF-053)

A boolean OUTPUT of a declared subscope — a characteristic on the callee —
read as a VOORWAARDE lowers to a navigated `CharacteristicCheck` over the
synthesised back-link (the condition sibling of the value-position
navigated `AttributeReference`; no new node). The exception default's guard reads
`overzees` of the minted `eigenaar` instance over the `Vondstaanslag_eigenaar`
back-link. Both executors carry the navigated check (anchor
jutterswet-kustwacht). Own-authored, rights-free.

```catala
declaration scope Eigenaar:
  input registratiezone content integer
  output overzees content boolean

scope Eigenaar:
  definition overzees equals registratiezone > 100

declaration scope Vondstaanslag:
  input vondstwaarde content integer
  input registratiezone content integer
  eigenaar scope Eigenaar
  output heffing content integer

scope Vondstaanslag:
  definition eigenaar.registratiezone equals registratiezone
  definition heffing equals vondstwaarde
  exception definition heffing
    under condition eigenaar.overzees
    consequence equals vondstwaarde * 2
```
